  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "我决定了！  (I Have Decided!)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "qin_xiao": "秦箫"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back in their dorm room, Bu Xiaogu shocks her friend Qin Xiao by giving up her sought-after television station internship to join Xingtian Entertainment, where star producer Chun Yuqiao works. Listen to their debate first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我放弃电视台，去星天娱乐。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "布小谷，你是不是疯了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "那里多少人挤破头都进不去！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我去那儿当实习生，就能上十二歌王的组。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我问你个问题，节目制作的核心业务在哪儿？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "制作公司。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "你敢说你不是为了他，放弃到手的金饭碗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "干咱们这行，谁不想跟他学习？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我决定了，我要去见他，跟他学习！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我放弃电视台，去星天娱乐。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am giving up the television network and going to Xingtian Entertainment.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "布小谷，你是不是疯了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Bu Xiaogu, have you gone crazy?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "那里多少人挤破头都进不去！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So many people fight tooth and nail and still cannot get in there!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我去那儿当实习生，就能上十二歌王的组。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If I go there as an intern, I can join the Twelve Singers crew.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我问你个问题，节目制作的核心业务在哪儿？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let me ask you a question: where is the core business of show production?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "制作公司。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Production companies.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "你敢说你不是为了他，放弃到手的金饭碗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Dare you say you are not giving up a golden job in hand because of him?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "干咱们这行，谁不想跟他学习？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Working in our line of work, who would not want to learn from him?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我决定了，我要去见他，跟他学习！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have decided — I am going to meet him and learn from him!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
